{"$schema": "https://skillpilot.com/schemas/goal-description-review/v1/goal-description-review-record.schema.json", "schemaVersion": 1, "recordId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run.record-001", "runId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run", "campaignId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-b", "roundId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-first-pass-b", "bundleFingerprint": "sha256:84106b0ff8a170c341c25f90c21200a73e3ee369c538d0fcc8e11f2884d7966c", "bookDigest": "sha256:5dfaad088aac9655734cbc22c9ea9a75487244e2032eba4b9753d6a3b378953e", "goalId": "95dc0ee5-a0af-5682-af32-d66e36fbeb50", "goalFingerprint": "sha256:0a2700c260fbc3ad421ab3a383a44231869bd398dff5b056b51e768401e8a5ab", "pageFingerprint": "sha256:a90b708be2cdb52b71c49132eb7ae6cdb3799b2f647e907fe241b33eb709ef50", "currentTitleDe": "Chemische Fach- und Symbolsprache ebenengerecht verwenden", "currentTitleEn": "Use chemical technical and symbolic language across levels", "currentDescriptionDe": "Die lernende Person kann zwischen Alltags- und Fachsprache übersetzen, Stoff- und Teilchenebene unterscheiden sowie Nomenklatur, Symbole und Formelsprache zur Beschreibung von Atomen, Molekülen, Ionen, Teilchenänderungen und Wechselwirkungen sachgerecht nutzen.", "currentDescriptionEn": "The learner can translate between everyday and technical language, distinguish substance and particle levels, and use nomenclature, symbols, and formula language to describe atoms, molecules, ions, particle changes, and interactions appropriately.", "decision": "keep", "understandingEvidence": {"essentialUnderstandingDe": "Stoffbeobachtung, Teilchenmodell und Formelsprache beschreiben verschiedene Ebenen desselben Vorgangs; NaCl bezeichnet ein Ionenverhältnis, Koeffizienten und Indizes haben verschiedene Bedeutungen.", "essentialUnderstandingEn": "Observable substances, particle models and formula language describe different levels of the same process; NaCl gives an ion ratio, and coefficients differ from subscripts.", "observablePerformanceDe": "Die Person übersetzt Salzlösung und Wasserbildung ebenengerecht, bilanziert Teilchen und Ladung und begründet NaCl(s) → Na+(aq) + Cl−(aq) ohne NaCl-Moleküle oder Natriummetall zu erfinden.", "observablePerformanceEn": "The learner translates salt dissolution and water formation across levels, balances particles and charge, and explains NaCl(s) → Na+(aq) + Cl−(aq) without inventing NaCl molecules or sodium metal.", "transferExpectationDe": "Sie begründet einen neuen Koeffizienten-/Index- oder Ionenschreibfall; nur im ausdrücklich gebundenen BY-C13-eA-Kontext überträgt sie systematische Namen mit gegebenen Prioritäten in Fischer-Projektionen und erkennt fehlende Stereoinformation.", "transferExpectationEn": "They justify a fresh coefficient/subscript or ion-notation case; only within the explicitly bound BY C13 eA context do they translate systematic names with supplied priorities into Fischer projections and identify missing stereochemical information."}, "rationale": "DE/EN agree on one cross-representation competence. The NaCl and water cases demand explanation rather than formula recall. Supplied Fischer rules make alanine/cysteine/serine transfer assessable: L is not invariably S, and a name without stereodescriptor does not specify one enantiomer. The extra expectation is explicitly local to BY C13 eA and its matching source/view; it is not a universal SekI requirement. The original water/particle/formula image supports the core goal.", "evidenceProfileContract": "positive-understanding-evidence-v2", "evidenceProfileRecommendation": "none", "recordStatus": "candidate", "reviewAuthority": "ai_candidate"}
{"$schema": "https://skillpilot.com/schemas/goal-description-review/v1/goal-description-review-record.schema.json", "schemaVersion": 1, "recordId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run.record-002", "runId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run", "campaignId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-b", "roundId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-first-pass-b", "bundleFingerprint": "sha256:84106b0ff8a170c341c25f90c21200a73e3ee369c538d0fcc8e11f2884d7966c", "bookDigest": "sha256:5dfaad088aac9655734cbc22c9ea9a75487244e2032eba4b9753d6a3b378953e", "goalId": "7371c82e-6668-5ddc-ba78-347113fcddf8", "goalFingerprint": "sha256:48158d684d086b515ae6480cd03b71cfefcad7cba2f8842d9dd0fe9453d3cc6e", "pageFingerprint": "sha256:2202458519e9847632b5f1ba98e968515b98461153ef02bab86bccb797547285", "currentTitleDe": "Fettverwendung kriteriengeleitet bewerten", "currentTitleEn": "Evaluate fat applications using criteria", "currentDescriptionDe": "Die lernende Person kann die Bedeutung von Fetten für Ernährung, Technik und nachwachsende Rohstoffe anhand geeigneter chemischer und nachhaltigkeitsbezogener Kriterien bewerten.", "currentDescriptionEn": "The learner can evaluate the significance of fats in nutrition, technology and renewable feedstocks using suitable chemical and sustainability criteria.", "decision": "keep", "understandingEvidence": {"essentialUnderstandingDe": "Fettstruktur, biologische Verwertbarkeit und Verwendungsbedingungen begründen Nutzungsurteile; cis-Anteil oder Pflanzenherkunft allein entscheiden weder Gesundheit noch Nachhaltigkeit.", "essentialUnderstandingEn": "Fat structure, biological usability and conditions of use inform application judgments; cis content or plant origin alone settles neither health nor sustainability.", "observablePerformanceDe": "Die Person wägt Lebensmittel-/Technikeignung, Oxidationsdaten, Kosten und Flächen-/Herkunftsbedingungen ab und erklärt Triacylglyceride über Glycerin, drei Esterbindungen und Fettsäurereste als nutzbare Nährstoffquelle.", "observablePerformanceEn": "The learner weighs food/technical suitability, oxidation data, cost and land/source conditions, and explains triacylglycerols through glycerol, three ester bonds and fatty-acid residues as a usable nutrient source.", "transferExpectationDe": "Bei geändertem Lager-, Nutzungs- oder Herkunftskontext prüft sie das Urteil neu und unterscheidet vorhandene Reststoffe von neuer Produktion; Paraffin wird trotz langer C/H-Ketten nicht als Nahrungsfett behandelt.", "transferExpectationEn": "With changed storage, use or sourcing conditions they reconsider the judgment and distinguish existing residues from new production; paraffin is not treated as dietary fat merely because it has long C/H chains."}, "rationale": "A single assessable evaluation competence connects nutrition, technical function and renewable feedstocks. All three complete profile cases give distinct decision conditions and require a reasoned choice and changed-context transfer. Food-grade status is a genuine condition, not a score that can be compensated by low price. Oxidation, melting and origin data are not inflated into a complete life-cycle or medical judgment. The retained straight/bent-residue image correctly supports packing as schematic background.", "evidenceProfileContract": "positive-understanding-evidence-v2", "evidenceProfileRecommendation": "none", "recordStatus": "candidate", "reviewAuthority": "ai_candidate"}
{"$schema": "https://skillpilot.com/schemas/goal-description-review/v1/goal-description-review-record.schema.json", "schemaVersion": 1, "recordId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run.record-003", "runId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run", "campaignId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-b", "roundId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-first-pass-b", "bundleFingerprint": "sha256:84106b0ff8a170c341c25f90c21200a73e3ee369c538d0fcc8e11f2884d7966c", "bookDigest": "sha256:5dfaad088aac9655734cbc22c9ea9a75487244e2032eba4b9753d6a3b378953e", "goalId": "058dca74-1b57-5eb3-9c94-1c7b6cc795ad", "goalFingerprint": "sha256:0a7730571fc9116f1aa42f8b251b72bb933de758b8a62e3380f624165906eac8", "pageFingerprint": "sha256:08af8dfa9e4c479489350a86fb7a971c7c0b1b2b48bbda8d0d4b06066e144270", "currentTitleDe": "Proteinlöslichkeit und Denaturierung erklären", "currentTitleEn": "Explain protein solubility and denaturation", "currentDescriptionDe": "Die lernende Person kann Löslichkeit und Denaturierung von Proteinen unter verschiedenen Reaktionsbedingungen erklären und Folgen für die Wirksamkeit von Enzymen in Stoffwechsel, Waschmitteln oder weiteren Kontexten ableiten.", "currentDescriptionEn": "The learner can explain protein solubility and denaturation under different reaction conditions and derive consequences for enzyme effectiveness in metabolism, detergents, or other contexts.", "decision": "keep", "understandingEvidence": {"essentialUnderstandingDe": "Proteinlöslichkeit und Funktion hängen von Struktur, Ladung, Wechselwirkungen und Bedingungen ab; Ausfällung, Denaturierung und Peptidspaltung sind verschiedene Vorgänge.", "essentialUnderstandingEn": "Protein solubility and function depend on structure, charge, interactions and conditions; precipitation, denaturation and peptide cleavage are distinct processes.", "observablePerformanceDe": "Die Person erklärt kontrollierte Eiweiß-, Salz- und Enzymdaten mit Strukturänderung, Aggregation oder reversiblem Aussalzen und berechnet Aktivitätsverluste nur aus vergleichbaren Aktivitätsmessungen.", "observablePerformanceEn": "The learner explains controlled protein, salt and enzyme data using structural change, aggregation or reversible salting out, and calculates activity losses only from comparable activity assays.", "transferExpectationDe": "Sie überträgt auf ein neues Stoffwechsel- oder Waschmittelenzym, trennt Vorbehandlung von Messbedingungen und sagt aus bloßer Trübung weder vollständige Inaktivität noch Peptidhydrolyse voraus.", "transferExpectationEn": "They transfer to a fresh metabolic or detergent enzyme, distinguish pretreatment from assay conditions, and infer neither complete inactivity nor peptide hydrolysis from cloudiness alone."}, "rationale": "The bilingual description names one causal structure–condition–function goal. The whole profile explicitly remains explanatory, with no required laboratory-performance claim. Cooled heat-treated egg white, reversible salt precipitation and common-condition enzyme assays separate observations from warranted inferences; 10→1 and 12→2 activity changes support 90% and about 83% loss. The denatured/inactive picture is an illustrative outcome, bounded by the profile’s explicit rejection of universal zero activity. Actual BY C13 eA wording directly covers solubility/denaturation and enzyme consequences.", "evidenceProfileContract": "positive-understanding-evidence-v2", "evidenceProfileRecommendation": "none", "recordStatus": "candidate", "reviewAuthority": "ai_candidate"}
{"$schema": "https://skillpilot.com/schemas/goal-description-review/v1/goal-description-review-record.schema.json", "schemaVersion": 1, "recordId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run.record-004", "runId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run", "campaignId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-b", "roundId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-first-pass-b", "bundleFingerprint": "sha256:84106b0ff8a170c341c25f90c21200a73e3ee369c538d0fcc8e11f2884d7966c", "bookDigest": "sha256:5dfaad088aac9655734cbc22c9ea9a75487244e2032eba4b9753d6a3b378953e", "goalId": "20f92ba0-f7f4-5407-bb96-07e30da9002f", "goalFingerprint": "sha256:135e9ea169246d3e7787a78dcdce9d9ae5b6d8796780b8dbf7c1b939cb5983c4", "pageFingerprint": "sha256:2955936a54212878a12dc188c0cd3cd45d1368f55d67d946d3d27eb3332d5574", "currentTitleDe": "Massenwirkungsgesetz anwenden", "currentTitleEn": "Apply Law of Mass Action", "currentDescriptionDe": "Die lernende Person kann das Massenwirkungsgesetz auf homogene Gleichgewichte anwenden, Gleichgewichtskonstanten vereinfachter Systeme berechnen und den Zahlenwert zur Aussage über die Lage des Gleichgewichts interpretieren.", "currentDescriptionEn": "The learner can apply the law of mass action to homogeneous equilibria, calculate equilibrium constants for simplified systems, and interpret the numerical value to infer the position of equilibrium.", "decision": "keep", "understandingEvidence": {"essentialUnderstandingDe": "Der MWG-Ausdruck gehört zu einer bestimmten bilanzierten Reaktion; bei fester Temperatur charakterisiert K das Gleichgewicht, während Q die momentane Zusammensetzung beschreibt und keine Reaktionsgeschwindigkeit ist.", "essentialUnderstandingEn": "A mass-action expression belongs to a specified balanced reaction; at fixed temperature K characterizes equilibrium while Q describes the current composition and is not a reaction rate.", "observablePerformanceDe": "Die Person bildet für die angegebenen homogenen idealisierten Systeme den passenden Ausdruck, berechnet K und Q, prüft zulässige Gleichgewichtskonzentrationen und deutet die Gleichgewichtslage.", "observablePerformanceEn": "The learner constructs the appropriate expression for the specified homogeneous idealized systems, calculates K and Q, checks admissible equilibrium concentrations and interprets the equilibrium position.", "transferExpectationDe": "Sie behandelt Umkehrreaktion oder geänderte Ausgangskonzentrationen konsistent, übernimmt K bei gleicher Temperatur und beachtet die ausdrücklich als gelöst modellierten Wasseranteile.", "transferExpectationEn": "They handle the reverse reaction or changed initial concentrations consistently, retain K at the same temperature and respect water explicitly modeled as a dissolved species."}, "rationale": "The complete profile states the idealized homogeneous model and standard-concentration convention, so it does not silently import a pure-water omission into the given dissolved-water case. K=4, reciprocal 1/25, and admissible extents 0.75 or 0.4 follow from the supplied equal-stoichiometry models. Position, quotient and rate are separated. The H2/I2/HI image has the correct exponents and K=16 example. Exact Hessian page44 distinguishes simplified gAN MWG from extended LK calculations; this own profile is not evidence that all its operations are universal official GK requirements.", "evidenceProfileContract": "positive-understanding-evidence-v2", "evidenceProfileRecommendation": "none", "recordStatus": "candidate", "reviewAuthority": "ai_candidate"}
{"$schema": "https://skillpilot.com/schemas/goal-description-review/v1/goal-description-review-record.schema.json", "schemaVersion": 1, "recordId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run.record-005", "runId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run", "campaignId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-b", "roundId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-first-pass-b", "bundleFingerprint": "sha256:84106b0ff8a170c341c25f90c21200a73e3ee369c538d0fcc8e11f2884d7966c", "bookDigest": "sha256:5dfaad088aac9655734cbc22c9ea9a75487244e2032eba4b9753d6a3b378953e", "goalId": "5a24dae0-6d33-5227-8d8b-e8f74c2ccc4c", "goalFingerprint": "sha256:2b1653fbe0758f2e17bac3759d5322ce75211135cf7c22dda85301fd7755bf63", "pageFingerprint": "sha256:c60db493729df071be5c0d61f25fa17aabc54c84217a6ab86832e483e2e09d1e", "currentTitleDe": "Le-Chatelier-Prinzip nutzen", "currentTitleEn": "Use Le Chatelier's principle", "currentDescriptionDe": "Die lernende Person kann mit dem Prinzip von Le Chatelier begründet vorhersagen, wie Konzentrations-, Druck- und Temperaturänderungen die Gleichgewichtslage beeinflussen, und daraus Folgen für technische Prozesse und Alltagsgleichgewichte ableiten.", "currentDescriptionEn": "The learner can use Le Chatelier’s principle to predict with reasons how changes in concentration, pressure and temperature affect the equilibrium position and derive consequences for technical processes and everyday equilibria.", "decision": "keep", "understandingEvidence": {"essentialUnderstandingDe": "Äußere Änderungen können Q oder K beeinflussen und damit eine Verschiebung auslösen; Katalyse ändert die Einstellungsgeschwindigkeit, nicht die Gleichgewichtslage.", "essentialUnderstandingEn": "External changes can affect Q or K and thereby induce a shift; catalysis changes the rate of equilibration rather than the equilibrium position.", "observablePerformanceDe": "Die Person begründet Konzentrations-, Druck- und Temperaturfolgen am Ammoniak- und Gaslöslichkeitsmodell unter Angabe von Gasstöchiometrie und Reaktionsenthalpie.", "observablePerformanceEn": "The learner explains concentration, pressure and temperature effects in ammonia and gas-solubility models using gas stoichiometry and reaction enthalpy.", "transferExpectationDe": "Bei gleicher Gasmolzahl, endothermer Dissoziation oder verändertem Gaspartialdruck prüft sie die Voraussetzungen neu und trennt Verschiebungsrichtung von einer absoluten Konzentrationsänderung bei Kompression.", "transferExpectationEn": "For equal gas amounts, endothermic dissociation or changed gas partial pressure, they recheck the conditions and separate shift direction from an absolute concentration change during compression."}, "rationale": "The description and complete cases require reasoned equilibrium predictions in technical and everyday contexts, one coherent application skill. The profile correctly handles exothermic ammonia, endothermic N2O4 dissociation, equal-mole H2/I2/HI, product removal and gas dissolution. It explicitly avoids inferring that absolute NO2 concentration must decrease during compression. The image’s pressure and heat examples include their necessary conditions. MWG is an appropriate direct prerequisite.", "evidenceProfileContract": "positive-understanding-evidence-v2", "evidenceProfileRecommendation": "none", "recordStatus": "candidate", "reviewAuthority": "ai_candidate"}
{"$schema": "https://skillpilot.com/schemas/goal-description-review/v1/goal-description-review-record.schema.json", "schemaVersion": 1, "recordId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run.record-006", "runId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run", "campaignId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-b", "roundId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-first-pass-b", "bundleFingerprint": "sha256:84106b0ff8a170c341c25f90c21200a73e3ee369c538d0fcc8e11f2884d7966c", "bookDigest": "sha256:5dfaad088aac9655734cbc22c9ea9a75487244e2032eba4b9753d6a3b378953e", "goalId": "56bc6377-1291-58bc-b433-5b9f673888e9", "goalFingerprint": "sha256:b3b30f05e93a05b0e2cb371994d29d632204e7d6b4b260c14ac8f8836c5bfff2", "pageFingerprint": "sha256:56c45d3a61ee8aab1f8845d6b31fe9002bc13b71cd889b4e92142cc59e311356", "currentTitleDe": "Geschwindigkeiten bestimmen", "currentTitleEn": "Determine rates", "currentDescriptionDe": "Die lernende Person kann Reaktionsgeschwindigkeit als Änderung von Stoffmenge oder Konzentration pro Zeiteinheit beschreiben und mittlere sowie momentane Reaktionsgeschwindigkeiten aus Konzentrations-, Stoffmengen- oder Zeit-Volumen-Diagrammen bestimmen.", "currentDescriptionEn": "The learner can describe reaction rate as a change in amount of substance or concentration per unit time and determine average and instantaneous reaction rates from concentration, amount-of-substance, or time-volume diagrams.", "decision": "keep", "understandingEvidence": {"essentialUnderstandingDe": "Mittlere Geschwindigkeit ist eine Sekantensteigung, momentane eine Tangentensteigung; Vorzeichen, Stoffmengen-/Konzentrationsbezug und stöchiometrische Normierung müssen unterschieden werden.", "essentialUnderstandingEn": "Average rate is a secant slope and instantaneous rate a tangent slope; sign, amount/concentration basis and stoichiometric normalization must be distinguished.", "observablePerformanceDe": "Die Person liest tatsächliche Achsen und Tangenten der vier Diagramme, bestimmt Δc/Δt bzw. Δn/Δt und rechnet Gasvolumenraten mit dem gegebenen molaren Volumen und Reaktionsvolumen um.", "observablePerformanceEn": "The learner reads actual axes and tangents in the four graphs, determines Δc/Δt or Δn/Δt and converts gas-volume rates using the supplied molar volume and reaction volume.", "transferExpectationDe": "Sie begründet, warum ein doppeltes Reaktionsvolumen die Stoffmengenrate, aber nicht die entsprechende Konzentrationsrate verdoppeln kann, und verwendet eine neue Tangente statt einer benachbarten Sekante.", "transferExpectationEn": "They explain why doubling reaction volume can double amount rate without doubling the corresponding concentration rate, and use a new tangent rather than a nearby secant."}, "rationale": "All four actual bound assessment graphs were viewed and agree with the axes/data used by the profile: A-consumption mean0.01 and tangent0.006 mol/L/s, double-volume amount tangent0.012 mol/s, gas tangent0.25mL/s and fresh0.48mL/s. The profile supplies stoichiometry and conversion conditions and separates species rates from normalized reaction rate. This is genuine graphical transfer. The general declining-concentration image is compatible. The direct prerequisite is orientation, not an implicit mastered mathematics requirement; the supplied materials teach the rate operations.", "evidenceProfileContract": "positive-understanding-evidence-v2", "evidenceProfileRecommendation": "none", "recordStatus": "candidate", "reviewAuthority": "ai_candidate"}
{"$schema": "https://skillpilot.com/schemas/goal-description-review/v1/goal-description-review-record.schema.json", "schemaVersion": 1, "recordId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run.record-007", "runId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run", "campaignId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-b", "roundId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-first-pass-b", "bundleFingerprint": "sha256:84106b0ff8a170c341c25f90c21200a73e3ee369c538d0fcc8e11f2884d7966c", "bookDigest": "sha256:5dfaad088aac9655734cbc22c9ea9a75487244e2032eba4b9753d6a3b378953e", "goalId": "3ce81f96-4fbb-5022-88b7-337a000315ed", "goalFingerprint": "sha256:1d5e3620ccb32c5cccd88d5250fd32a06500d315963028b49a3583e28eb08adc", "pageFingerprint": "sha256:9f680e73b09ec25d7de548e3b4208d7ff77f53d89ffb274016b4d32cb01cb33e", "currentTitleDe": "Einflussfaktoren diskutieren", "currentTitleEn": "Discuss influencing factors", "currentDescriptionDe": "Die lernende Person kann den Einfluss von Stoffart, Konzentration, Zerteilungsgrad und Temperatur auf die Reaktionsgeschwindigkeit qualitativ erklären und diese Einflüsse auf Teilchenebene mit der Stoßtheorie begründen.", "currentDescriptionEn": "The learner can qualitatively explain the influence of substance type, concentration, degree of division, and temperature on reaction rate and justify these influences at particle level using collision theory.", "decision": "keep", "understandingEvidence": {"essentialUnderstandingDe": "Reaktionsgeschwindigkeit hängt von wirksamen Teilchenbegegnungen, zugänglicher Grenzfläche und Aktivierungsbedingungen ab; die Einflussgrößen müssen unter passenden Vergleichsbedingungen betrachtet werden.", "essentialUnderstandingEn": "Reaction rate depends on effective particle encounters, accessible interface and activation conditions; influencing factors require suitable controlled comparisons.", "observablePerformanceDe": "Die Person erklärt Stoffart, Konzentration, Zerteilung und Temperatur mit Teilchenmodellen und begründet bei gleicher Stoffmenge den Oberflächen- statt eines bloßen Mengeneffekts.", "observablePerformanceEn": "The learner explains substance type, concentration, division and temperature with particle models and, at fixed amount, identifies a surface effect rather than merely an amount effect.", "transferExpectationDe": "Sie erkennt beim erhitzten Enzym die Grenze eines unveränderten Katalysatormodells und behandelt einen zugesetzten Fremdstoff bei gleicher Eduktkonzentration als möglichen Mechanismus-/Katalyseeffekt.", "transferExpectationEn": "They recognize that heating an enzyme can invalidate the unchanged-catalyst model and treat an added substance at fixed reactant concentration as a possible mechanism or catalytic effect."}, "rationale": "This is one qualitative causal explanation competence building on rate determination. The complete profile controls concentration, mass and area, requires an activation-energy account of temperature, and rejects both bond-strength-only ranking and a universal temperature-always-increases-rate assertion for denaturing enzymes. The retained image supplies a schematic particle comparison rather than numerical rate evidence. HE page46 supplies Q3.5 factor scope and page47 the Q4.1 collision-theory connection.", "evidenceProfileContract": "positive-understanding-evidence-v2", "evidenceProfileRecommendation": "none", "recordStatus": "candidate", "reviewAuthority": "ai_candidate"}
{"$schema": "https://skillpilot.com/schemas/goal-description-review/v1/goal-description-review-record.schema.json", "schemaVersion": 1, "recordId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run.record-008", "runId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run", "campaignId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-b", "roundId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-first-pass-b", "bundleFingerprint": "sha256:84106b0ff8a170c341c25f90c21200a73e3ee369c538d0fcc8e11f2884d7966c", "bookDigest": "sha256:5dfaad088aac9655734cbc22c9ea9a75487244e2032eba4b9753d6a3b378953e", "goalId": "ecce0306-13dc-5563-a097-afe69805a8d6", "goalFingerprint": "sha256:8c1b842e3f996b0829dcdb61f14bd223d6414f45a55aaba298177bb42df3a9d6", "pageFingerprint": "sha256:d886ca86f64fbb260b8876e4cac30d2737919f9d6f94fd1aef4547475fb762da", "currentTitleDe": "Brennstoffzellen bewerten", "currentTitleEn": "Evaluate fuel cells", "currentDescriptionDe": "Die lernende Person kann Elektrodenreaktionen in sauren und alkalischen Brennstoffzellen erläutern und Vor- sowie Nachteile diskutieren.", "currentDescriptionEn": "The learner can explain electrode reactions in acidic and alkaline fuel cells and discuss advantages and disadvantages.", "decision": "keep", "understandingEvidence": {"essentialUnderstandingDe": "Brennstoffzellen koppeln getrennte Oxidation und Reduktion über einen äußeren Elektronenweg und den passenden inneren Ionentransport; Vorteile hängen auch von Wasserstoffbereitstellung und Betriebsbedingungen ab.", "essentialUnderstandingEn": "Fuel cells couple separated oxidation and reduction through an external electron path and the appropriate internal ion transport; advantages also depend on hydrogen production and operating conditions.", "observablePerformanceDe": "Die Person bilanziert saure und alkalische H2/O2-Halbreaktionen, erläutert H+- bzw. OH−-Transport und bewertet die gegebenen Betriebs-, Bereitstellungs- und Infrastrukturangaben.", "observablePerformanceEn": "The learner balances acidic and alkaline H2/O2 half-reactions, explains H+ or OH− transport, and evaluates the supplied operation, production and infrastructure data.", "transferExpectationDe": "Sie prüft einen geänderten Strommix oder Zelltyp mit passenden Systemgrenzen und behandelt Carbonat-/CO-Einflüsse als bedingte Erklärungen statt als aus einer Spannung allein bewiesene Ursache.", "transferExpectationEn": "They reassess a changed electricity mix or cell type with suitable boundaries and treat carbonate/CO effects as conditional explanations rather than a unique cause proved by voltage alone."}, "rationale": "The acid and alkaline half-reactions in the whole profile and original image balance atoms and charge; OH− moves from oxygen to hydrogen side in the alkaline cell. The complete supplied fictional-bus dataset yields495kWh and198kgCO2 per100km, with clean tailpipe separated from production emissions. Alkaline/AEM and contamination transfer retain their conditions and do not turn the KOH example into every fuel-cell design. Basic-cell knowledge is a coherent prerequisite. Exact HE page48 includes acid/alkaline electrodes and pros/cons in optional Q4.2.", "evidenceProfileContract": "positive-understanding-evidence-v2", "evidenceProfileRecommendation": "none", "recordStatus": "candidate", "reviewAuthority": "ai_candidate"}
{"$schema": "https://skillpilot.com/schemas/goal-description-review/v1/goal-description-review-record.schema.json", "schemaVersion": 1, "recordId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run.record-009", "runId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run", "campaignId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-b", "roundId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-first-pass-b", "bundleFingerprint": "sha256:84106b0ff8a170c341c25f90c21200a73e3ee369c538d0fcc8e11f2884d7966c", "bookDigest": "sha256:5dfaad088aac9655734cbc22c9ea9a75487244e2032eba4b9753d6a3b378953e", "goalId": "3ec31fe1-e01b-5edd-bd9a-936191d67639", "goalFingerprint": "sha256:f0abdaf037371e8c2bf0a89334f2ac63a9173a9d6ea30d6d851359c7e2883eff", "pageFingerprint": "sha256:6a36bdaf664f8fe086e4cd71f744bd993645c6200a3fdb74765d77b5afc6ac8a", "currentTitleDe": "Wirkungsgrade vergleichen", "currentTitleEn": "Compare efficiencies", "currentDescriptionDe": "Die lernende Person kann Wirkungsgrade verschiedener Energiewandler berechnen und vergleichen.", "currentDescriptionEn": "The learner can calculate and compare efficiencies of various energy converters.", "decision": "keep", "understandingEvidence": {"essentialUnderstandingDe": "Wirkungsgrad ist nutzbare Energie dividiert durch zugeführte Energie mit ausdrücklichem Nutzen- und Systembezug; gekoppelte Wärme ist nur bei tatsächlicher Nutzung nutzbar.", "essentialUnderstandingEn": "Efficiency is useful energy divided by input energy with an explicit service and system boundary; cogenerated heat is useful only when actually used.", "observablePerformanceDe": "Die Person berechnet elektrische, Gesamt- und bedarfsgerechte Wirkungsgrade samt gegebenen Unsicherheiten und vergleicht Ketten auf derselben Bezugsgröße.", "observablePerformanceEn": "The learner calculates electrical, total and demand-limited efficiencies with the supplied uncertainties and compares conversion chains on the same basis.", "transferExpectationDe": "Sie normiert auf gleiche Nutzenergie oder einen geänderten Wärmebedarf, rechnet Netz- und Primärenergiegrenzen sauber um und erklärt, warum Motor und Lampe keine austauschbaren Dienste liefern.", "transferExpectationEn": "They normalize to the same useful energy or changed heat demand, convert socket and primary-energy boundaries consistently, and explain why a motor and lamp provide different services."}, "rationale": "The short bilingual description is made precisely assessable by complete A/B co-generation and mobility-chain cases. All stated efficiencies and bounds follow from the data: A30/80/50%, B60/85/70%, socket82% versus primary32.8%, combustion25%. Fixed heat demand limits the counted useful heat. Motor80% versus lamp5% in the unchanged image is a valid numerical fraction comparison, with the profile explicitly preventing an environmental or substitutability conclusion. One ratio-and-boundary competence suffices; no split is needed.", "evidenceProfileContract": "positive-understanding-evidence-v2", "evidenceProfileRecommendation": "none", "recordStatus": "candidate", "reviewAuthority": "ai_candidate"}
{"$schema": "https://skillpilot.com/schemas/goal-description-review/v1/goal-description-review-record.schema.json", "schemaVersion": 1, "recordId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run.record-010", "runId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run", "campaignId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-b", "roundId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-first-pass-b", "bundleFingerprint": "sha256:84106b0ff8a170c341c25f90c21200a73e3ee369c538d0fcc8e11f2884d7966c", "bookDigest": "sha256:5dfaad088aac9655734cbc22c9ea9a75487244e2032eba4b9753d6a3b378953e", "goalId": "e20d205f-03a4-5f96-b456-9b20460605a2", "goalFingerprint": "sha256:9ff3425b376074e63ed2149a0ca9c8b837aaf8b1c2582e37f10d9d57b6f7bf7e", "pageFingerprint": "sha256:62d7980cd029aab321e083eff7ddb99fc30b664d4805b8e32d8626ac6140d50c", "currentTitleDe": "Life-Cycle-Assessment anwenden", "currentTitleEn": "Apply Life Cycle Assessment", "currentDescriptionDe": "Die lernende Person kann vereinfachte Ökobilanzen für Energieträger erstellen und interpretieren.", "currentDescriptionEn": "The learner can create and interpret simplified life cycle assessments for energy carriers.", "decision": "keep", "understandingEvidence": {"essentialUnderstandingDe": "Eine vereinfachte Ökobilanz benötigt Funktionseinheit, Systemgrenze, konsistente Inventarflüsse und begrenzte Wirkungsaussagen; Kohlenstoffaufnahme und Gutschriften dürfen nicht doppelt oder unbegründet bilanziert werden.", "essentialUnderstandingEn": "A simplified life-cycle assessment needs a functional unit, system boundary, consistent inventory flows and bounded impact claims; carbon uptake and credits must not be double-counted or invented.", "observablePerformanceDe": "Die Person erstellt aus den vollständigen Daten eine begrenzte Klimabilanz, erklärt biogenen Kohlenstoff, Landnutzung und tatsächlich nutzbare Wärmegutschriften und interpretiert die Ergebnisgrenzen.", "observablePerformanceEn": "The learner constructs a bounded climate account from the full data, explains biogenic carbon, land use and actually usable heat credits, and interprets the limits of the result.", "transferExpectationDe": "Bei gleicher Radenergie, verändertem Landnutzungsbeitrag oder geringem verdrängtem Wärmefaktor berechnet sie neu und fordert fehlende Umwandlungsdaten, bevor sie H2-Energie mit geliefertem Strom vergleicht.", "transferExpectationEn": "For equal wheel energy, changed land-use contribution or a smaller displaced-heat factor, they recalculate and request missing conversion data before comparing hydrogen energy with delivered electricity."}, "rationale": "The whole profile explicitly describes its climate balance as a bounded component rather than a complete environmental certification. Complete biofuel data give40 versus95gCO2e/MJ, land-use120, and matched-service48 versus95; the H2 case gives0.35 gross minus justified0.05 heat credit=0.30, or0.346 at the changed factor. A flat0.4 credit cannot prove negative emissions. The actual LCA image shows an inventory/interpretation/improvement process compatible with this simplified goal. This is one model-building and interpretation competence.", "evidenceProfileContract": "positive-understanding-evidence-v2", "evidenceProfileRecommendation": "none", "recordStatus": "candidate", "reviewAuthority": "ai_candidate"}
{"$schema": "https://skillpilot.com/schemas/goal-description-review/v1/goal-description-review-record.schema.json", "schemaVersion": 1, "recordId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run.record-011", "runId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run", "campaignId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-b", "roundId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-first-pass-b", "bundleFingerprint": "sha256:84106b0ff8a170c341c25f90c21200a73e3ee369c538d0fcc8e11f2884d7966c", "bookDigest": "sha256:5dfaad088aac9655734cbc22c9ea9a75487244e2032eba4b9753d6a3b378953e", "goalId": "1873eb42-1c85-548e-918c-4f4f73ed784f", "goalFingerprint": "sha256:9ee51b724226865629266172de238d76caec2258e2f55f1e222432b96f76c6cb", "pageFingerprint": "sha256:f7917c0a941dff30c4f31ea0e085f33a9230511c4d0f58828302aab91058e0e9", "currentTitleDe": "Elektromobilität energetisch und quellenkritisch bewerten", "currentTitleEn": "Evaluate electromobility energetically and with source critique", "currentDescriptionDe": "Die lernende Person kann Elektromobilität hinsichtlich Effizienz aus energetischer, ökonomischer und ökologischer Sicht bewerten und Herkunft sowie Validität verwendeter Informationen berücksichtigen.", "currentDescriptionEn": "The learner can evaluate electromobility regarding efficiency from energetic, economic, and ecological perspectives and take account of the origin and validity of the information used.", "decision": "keep", "understandingEvidence": {"essentialUnderstandingDe": "Energetische, wirtschaftliche und klimatische Vergleiche von Elektromobilität benötigen gleiche Dienste, passende Energiegrenzen sowie überprüfbare Herkunft und Gültigkeit der Daten.", "essentialUnderstandingEn": "Energy, economic and climate comparisons of electromobility need matched services, compatible energy boundaries and checkable data origin and validity.", "observablePerformanceDe": "Die Person berechnet aus gleich bezogenen Fahrdaten Wirkungsgrade, Nutzungs- und Herstellungsbeiträge sowie Kosten- und Klimaschwellen und trennt unpassende Werbe-/Herstellerangaben von vergleichbaren Daten.", "observablePerformanceEn": "The learner calculates efficiencies, use and production contributions, and cost and climate break-even distances from matched driving data, separating incompatible advertising/manufacturer figures from comparable data.", "transferExpectationDe": "Sie bewertet bei geändertem Strommix oder Winterdaten neu, hält CO2- und Kostenschwelle getrennt und erkennt, wenn höhere Betriebs- plus Herstellungsbelastung keinen positiven Klimaschnittpunkt ergeben.", "transferExpectationEn": "They reassess a changed electricity mix or winter dataset, keep carbon and cost break-even separate, and recognize when higher use plus production burdens yield no positive climate break-even."}, "rationale": "The exact BY C12 eA original directly combines energetic/economic/ecological efficiency with source validity. Complete matched-distance material gives EV65% socket/26% primary versus about22.16% fuel, carbon break-even53333km and cost111111km; altered grid factors change carbon, not the unchanged cost assumptions. The winter counterexample permits no positive climate break-even while costs may favor the EV. This source-critical comparison is a single coherent assessment skill, distinct from merely knowing a battery. The bound image supports criteria and information checking without claiming a universal winner.", "evidenceProfileContract": "positive-understanding-evidence-v2", "evidenceProfileRecommendation": "none", "recordStatus": "candidate", "reviewAuthority": "ai_candidate"}
{"$schema": "https://skillpilot.com/schemas/goal-description-review/v1/goal-description-review-record.schema.json", "schemaVersion": 1, "recordId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run.record-012", "runId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run", "campaignId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-b", "roundId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-first-pass-b", "bundleFingerprint": "sha256:84106b0ff8a170c341c25f90c21200a73e3ee369c538d0fcc8e11f2884d7966c", "bookDigest": "sha256:5dfaad088aac9655734cbc22c9ea9a75487244e2032eba4b9753d6a3b378953e", "goalId": "7dc80ee2-64e3-50c1-8aaa-0fef0ed0919d", "goalFingerprint": "sha256:9097ae929906c69d4477b16f6718eb40f4947ee21d7a64728215726d8bb55610", "pageFingerprint": "sha256:1ec0ba044dafe5af2e916a2a9855a1fc8bebcc40f4579397c89f48f5d814a106", "currentTitleDe": "Künstliche Photosynthese und Wasserstoffspeicherung bewerten", "currentTitleEn": "Evaluate artificial photosynthesis and hydrogen storage", "currentDescriptionDe": "Die lernende Person kann elektrochemische und photokatalytische Wasserspaltung sowie physikalische und chemische Wasserstoffspeicherung vergleichen und im Hinblick auf künstliche Photosynthese, Rohstoff- und Katalysatorbedarf sowie Energiespeicherpotenzial ökonomisch und ökologisch bewerten.", "currentDescriptionEn": "The learner can compare electrochemical and photocatalytic water splitting as well as physical and chemical hydrogen storage and evaluate them economically and ecologically with respect to artificial photosynthesis, raw materials, catalysts, and energy storage potential.", "decision": "keep", "understandingEvidence": {"essentialUnderstandingDe": "Wasserspaltung speichert zugeführte Energie in H2; Erzeugung, Speicherung und Rücknutzung haben getrennte Verluste und Rohstoffbedingungen, und H2-Erzeugung allein entspricht keiner vollständigen Zucker-Photosynthese.", "essentialUnderstandingEn": "Water splitting stores supplied energy in hydrogen; generation, storage and reuse have separate losses and material conditions, and hydrogen generation alone is not complete sugar-producing photosynthesis.", "observablePerformanceDe": "Die Person vergleicht elektrochemische und photokatalytische Erzeugung sowie physikalische und chemische Speicher mit den gegebenen Energie-, Massen-, Lebensdauer- und Katalysatordaten.", "observablePerformanceEn": "The learner compares electrochemical and photocatalytic generation and physical and chemical storage using the supplied energy, mass, lifetime and catalyst data.", "transferExpectationDe": "Sie prüft neue Ausbeute-/Lebensdauerbedingungen oder verfügbare Abwärme, bezieht Energie auf ein vollständig beladenes Speichersystem und verrechnet Wärme nicht stillschweigend wie Strom.", "transferExpectationEn": "They examine changed yield/lifetime conditions or available waste heat, relate energy to the fully loaded storage system and do not silently treat heat as electricity."}, "rationale": "Actual BY C13 eA explicitly joins water splitting, storage, artificial photosynthesis and resource/catalyst evaluation, so the integrated goal is source-coherent rather than a miscellaneous bundle. Complete materials give1.19 versus0.68kWh retained H2 energy; tank31.635kWh/11kg versus hydride59.94kWh/100kg. Heat for hydride release is not blindly deducted as equal electric work, catalyst mass is not sufficient for a sustainability winner, and water splitting is not conflated with CO2-to-sugar chemistry. The three current prerequisites support the extended evaluation; the diagram is a valid schematic.", "evidenceProfileContract": "positive-understanding-evidence-v2", "evidenceProfileRecommendation": "none", "recordStatus": "candidate", "reviewAuthority": "ai_candidate"}
{"$schema": "https://skillpilot.com/schemas/goal-description-review/v1/goal-description-review-record.schema.json", "schemaVersion": 1, "recordId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run.record-013", "runId": "chemie-current439-P13-independent-b-20261017-v1-run", "campaignId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-b", "roundId": "chemie-current439-P13-current-profile-context-technical-root-20261017-v1-first-pass-b", "bundleFingerprint": "sha256:84106b0ff8a170c341c25f90c21200a73e3ee369c538d0fcc8e11f2884d7966c", "bookDigest": "sha256:5dfaad088aac9655734cbc22c9ea9a75487244e2032eba4b9753d6a3b378953e", "goalId": "1df17884-96ae-57d7-9da9-dbebd082596f", "goalFingerprint": "sha256:dbff718cc903cbd09032e8f90486b2c22d4f81aff92f04b0baeb7e3716f02de7", "pageFingerprint": "sha256:3962e87e192d2d4144773aa4914ad4f9719011e3bc52ca376b2a08f317853763", "currentTitleDe": "Chemische Handlungsoptionen kriteriengeleitet bewerten", "currentTitleEn": "Evaluate chemical action options using criteria", "currentDescriptionDe": "Die lernende Person kann bei einer chemisch relevanten Alltags- oder Gesellschaftsentscheidung ethische, ökologische, ökonomische, soziale und sicherheitsbezogene Kriterien ableiten, Chancen und Risiken beurteilen, begründete Handlungsoptionen formulieren und mit einer passenden Entscheidungsstrategie abwägen. Sie überprüft Entscheidung, Kriterien und Strategie und reflektiert Möglichkeiten und Grenzen chemischer Sichtweisen.", "currentDescriptionEn": "The learner can derive ethical, environmental, economic, social, and safety-related criteria for a chemistry-related everyday or societal decision, assess opportunities and risks, formulate justified options, and weigh them using a suitable decision strategy. They review the decision, criteria, and strategy and reflect on the possibilities and limits of chemical perspectives.", "decision": "keep", "understandingEvidence": {"essentialUnderstandingDe": "Chemische Daten begründen fallbezogene Handlungsmöglichkeiten, aber normative Gewichtung und Teilhabe folgen nicht allein aus Chemie; Kriterien, Strategie und Entscheidung müssen bei neuen Bedingungen überprüft werden.", "essentialUnderstandingEn": "Chemical data inform case-specific action options, but normative weighting and participation do not follow from chemistry alone; criteria, strategy and decision require review when conditions change.", "observablePerformanceDe": "Die Person leitet alle fünf Kriterienarten am konkreten Dossier ab, entwickelt Optionen, beurteilt Chancen und Risiken und begründet eine Strategie mit Sicherheits-/Zugangsbedingungen und transparenten Gewichtungen.", "observablePerformanceEn": "The learner derives all five criterion types from the actual dossier, develops options, assesses opportunities and risks, and justifies a strategy with safety/access conditions and transparent weights.", "transferExpectationDe": "Sie überprüft bei geänderter Rücklaufquote, Kostenübernahme, Sprache oder Quellenfinanzierung tatsächlich Entscheidung und Strategie; fehlende Umweltfaktoren werden nicht erfunden und aus Löslichkeit wird keine individuelle Arzneitherapie abgeleitet.", "transferExpectationEn": "They actually reconsider decision and strategy after changed returns, subsidy, language or source funding; missing environmental factors are not invented and solubility is not turned into individual medicine advice."}, "rationale": "The longer bilingual goal remains one observable decision cycle, with criteria derivation, options, weighing and reflection as dependent stages. The two newly supplied exact whole packaging/information dossiers supply the missing initial20/40/100kg and A/B/C conditions; their full task/transfer responses are scientifically bounded. The two complete ethanol scenarios add health/social consequences without diagnosis or universal dependence claims. Chemical indicators are not added as one environmental total, funding is not automatically falsity, and solubility is not clinical efficacy. Actual BY C13 B5–B9/B14 confirms strategic/reflexive scope, while the local scope contract retains guided lower-year versus independent upper-year demand.", "evidenceProfileContract": "positive-understanding-evidence-v2", "evidenceProfileRecommendation": "none", "recordStatus": "candidate", "reviewAuthority": "ai_candidate"}
